# {{.Title}}

A Unity game starter for [Vapour](https://vapour.ink).

For AI assistants: run `vapour llm`.

## Project layout

- `Assets/`, `Packages/`, `ProjectSettings/` — Unity project files
- `build/web/` — WebGL export for `vapour publish`

## Export for web

1. In Unity: **File → Build Profiles → Web**, build into `build/web/`. Choose a gzip/brotli-free build (Decompression Fallback on) or keep the default; Vapour serves what you upload.

For quit handling on WebGL, call `Vapour.VapourBridge.Quit()` instead of `Application.Quit()`. It calls
`window.vapour.quit()` when running in the Vapour player, and falls back to `Application.Quit()` elsewhere.

## Publish to Vapour

1. `vapour publish --version 0.1.0 --notes "First release"`
